| `+unnumbered` | boolean | default `false` | Skip this sub-section's number, regardless of number-depth (#218). Outside the numbered sequence — no number, no counter advance, subtree unnumbered; the next numbered sibling continues unbroken. See notes/specs/toc-and-numbering.md. Authored as +unnumbered. |

